  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a saucepan over medium heat. Add the onion and cook for 5 minutes, stirring often, until soft but not browned.",
    "Add the diced potato and vegetable stock. Bring to a simmer and cook for about 10 minutes, until the potato is tender.",
    "Add the peas and cook for 2 to 3 minutes, just until bright green and hot.",
    "Stir in the mint, salt, black pepper, and lemon juice, then remove from the heat.",
    "Blend the soup until smooth, then taste and adjust the seasoning if needed. Serve hot."
